# Applies to every response served from public/ (Workers Static Assets honors _headers the
# same way Cloudflare Pages does). Worker-generated responses (/api/*, the calendar feed) get
# their own headers from middleware in src/index.ts — _headers does NOT cover them.
#
# script-src is now plain 'self'. The app shell moved out of an inline <script> into
# /js/app.js, and the ~96 KB unpkg Lucide bundle was replaced by a self-hosted sprite
# (scripts/build-icons.mjs). There is no third-party script origin and no inline script left,
# so neither an injected <script> nor a compromised CDN can execute anything.
#
# style-src is plain 'self' too: the inline <style> block moved to /css/app.css and all 151
# style="..." attributes became classes. Genuinely computed values (a bar width, a
# per-milestone colour) are applied through the CSSOM, which CSP does not restrict. With
# 'unsafe-inline' present, any markup an attacker injected could also carry its own styling —
# enough to hide the read-only warning banner or overlay a convincing fake dialog.
#
# Fonts are self-hosted from /fonts, so fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com are gone as
# well. That leaves NO third-party origin anywhere, which is why default-src can be 'none':
# anything not explicitly named below is denied outright.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# The font files are content-stable and versioned by filename, so they can be cached hard.
# index.html deliberately is not: it is the entry point that references everything else.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
